## Story Description
Write comprehensive unit tests for all categorisation modules in tests/test_categorisation.py. Minimum 12 tests covering all 3 deterministic passes, embedding classifier, LLM dry-run mode, and the orchestrator. All tests must pass.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: tests/test_categorisation.py — write minimum 12 test functions
- Test DeterministicCategoriser: test_gl_mapping_6420_returns_office_supplies, test_gl_mapping_prefix_fallback (6420100 matches GL prefix 6420), test_supplier_mapping_telstra_returns_it_telecoms, test_supplier_mapping_dhl_returns_logistics, test_keyword_toner_returns_office_supplies, test_keyword_catering_returns_facilities, test_keyword_freight_returns_logistics, test_keyword_mobile_fleet_returns_it
- Test EmbeddingCategoriser: test_embedding_classify_returns_tuple_of_correct_shape, test_embedding_unavailable_returns_passthrough (mock ImportError)
- Test LLMCategoriser: test_dry_run_returns_empty_classifications (all items get method=DRY_RUN), test_dry_run_makes_no_api_calls
- Test SpendCategoriser orchestrator: test_categorise_sample_data_80pct_medium_or_high_confidence, test_review_queue_sorted_by_spend_desc
